    "settings.mcp.agentSetup.mcp.agent.title": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Configure with an AI Agent" } },
        "zh-Hans": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "使用 AI Agent 配置" } }
      }
    },
    "settings.mcp.agentSetup.mcp.title": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Install MCP Service"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安装 MCP Service"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "settings.mcp.agentSetup.mcpManualPrompt": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "# Configure Starcat MCP Service Manually\n\n1. Run `command -v starcat` and copy the absolute path.\n2. Add a user-level stdio MCP Server to your client:\n   - Name: starcat\n   - Command: the absolute path from step 1\n   - Args: [\"mcp\"]\n   - Transport: stdio\n3. Keep Starcat running with MCP Service enabled.\n4. Restart or reload the MCP client, then complete initialize and tools/list, and call the read-only tool starcat.get_capabilities.\n\nDo not configure an endpoint or Local API Key in the MCP client."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "# 手动配置 Starcat MCP Service\n\n1. 运行 `command -v starcat` 并复制绝对路径。\n2. 在 MCP 客户端中添加用户级 stdio MCP Server：\n   - Name: starcat\n   - Command: 第 1 步得到的绝对路径\n   - Args: [\"mcp\"]\n   - Transport: stdio\n3. 保持 Starcat 运行并开启 MCP Service。\n4. 重启或重新加载 MCP 客户端，然后完成 initialize 和 tools/list，并调用只读工具 starcat.get_capabilities。\n\n不要在 MCP 客户端中配置 endpoint 或 Local API Key。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "settings.mcp.agentSetup.mcpPrompt": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "# Install Starcat MCP Service\n\nConfigure the current AI agent with a user-level MCP Server:\n\n- Name: starcat\n- Command: the absolute path returned by `command -v starcat` (or the Windows equivalent)\n- Args: [\"mcp\"]\n- Transport: stdio\n- Resulting launch command: `starcat mcp`\n\nRequirements:\n1. If the CLI is missing, prefer Homebrew on macOS or Linux (`brew tap dong4j/starcat-cli && brew install starcat`); otherwise use the official `dong4j/starcat-cli` Release installer.\n2. Run `starcat doctor --json`; if it is not paired, ask me for one-time pairing instructions and use `starcat pair --stdin`.\n3. Complete initialize and tools/list, then call the read-only tool starcat.get_capabilities.\n4. Do not call write tools during installation verification.\n5. Never ask me for a Local API Key or store credentials in a repository.\n6. Starcat must remain running with MCP Service enabled."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "# 安装 Starcat MCP Service\n\n请在当前 AI Agent 中添加用户级 MCP Server：\n\n- Name: starcat\n- Command: `command -v starcat` 返回的绝对路径（Windows 使用对应命令）\n- Args: [\"mcp\"]\n- Transport: stdio\n- 最终启动命令：`starcat mcp`\n\n要求：\n1. 如果尚未安装 CLI，macOS 或 Linux 优先使用 Homebrew（`brew tap dong4j/starcat-cli && brew install starcat`），其他情况使用官方 `dong4j/starcat-cli` Release 安装脚本。\n2. 运行 `starcat doctor --json`；如提示未配对，请让我复制一次性配对说明，并使用 `starcat pair --stdin`。\n3. 完成 initialize 和 tools/list 后调用只读工具 starcat.get_capabilities。\n4. 验证期间不要调用写入工具。\n5. 不要向我索取 Local API Key，也不要把凭据写入仓库。\n6. Starcat 必须保持运行，并已开启 MCP Service。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "settings.mcp.agentSetup.security.help": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Installation prompts contain no long-term credential. Pair only trusted devices and review the confirmation shown by Starcat."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安装说明不包含长期凭据。请只配对可信设备，并核对 Starcat 显示的确认信息。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
